== CPU ==
Kernel instrumented runs: 2 × 168 D+Dctl (the first without the step-2 sums; 687 + 730 s wall on
8 threads), 168 C+Cctl (755 s), 88 counterfactual runs (173 + 130 + 331 + 523 s); the driven
linked-variant and partition runs (~25 min wall on 4 threads, alongside), analyses and checks.
About 9 CPU-hours (rough tally, wall × threads; the machine was shared by concurrent jobs of mine).

